  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `1.1.4` to `1.2.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/1.1.4...net_conduit_tcp/1.2.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `1.1.4` to `1.2.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/1.1.4...net_conduit_websocket/1.2.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` to `1.2.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/commits/net_conduit_udp/1.2.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` to `1.2.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/commits/net_conduit_ipc/1.2.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` to `1.2.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/commits/net_conduit_quic/1.2.1)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Add support for UDP, IPC, and QUIC transports by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/26\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251205113258.aec8072...build.20251206021906.0448ba7",
